1
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,520
Just hit me.

2
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:13,710
That's why you followed me.

3
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:20,080
What a bad luck to came across you.

4
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:27,470
Will San come back to me if I hit you?

5
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,670
Okay, I'll hit you.

6
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,670
I'll hit you a hundred of times.

7
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,970
I'm sorry.

8
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:36,560
I hate you.

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,420
Why?

10
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,280
What is it?

11
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:42,100
You bitch!

12
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:46,680
What happened to San?

13
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:50,150
What do you mean?

14
00:00:54,350 --> 00:01:03,020
San is dead.

15
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:19,610
Parole?

16
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:27,430
My friend betrayed me.

17
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:33,200
I would've gotten 3 more years for another crime.

18
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:36,780
They asked me to prevent you from getting parole.

19
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:39,300
If I made you cause some small trouble,

20
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:43,020
they'd let me go.

21
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:47,680
I did what they asked me to do.

22
00:01:51,770 --> 00:01:58,340
Yujeong, have you offended anyone?

23
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:10,300
You're not a person who'd do anything wrong,

24
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:14,370
so I thought I could do something do the child.

25
00:02:14,370 --> 00:02:16,080
He asked me to do that.

26
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:21,300
He said he would take care of San. I swear.

27
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:23,670
Stay in jail.

28
00:02:23,670 --> 00:02:26,490
When you get out, I'll make your life miserable.

29
00:02:26,490 --> 00:02:28,450
You should suffer as much as I did.

30
00:02:28,450 --> 00:02:32,220
You should know how it feels when you lose your loved ones.

31
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:37,000
You have to realise how painful it is.

32
00:03:10,210 --> 00:03:12,730
Hey! Designated driver!

33
00:03:14,990 --> 00:03:18,030
What are you doing so late at night?

34
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,480
Who were you meeting?

35
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,540
Do I have to answer this question?

36
00:03:21,540 --> 00:03:22,430
What?

37
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:25,080
Though I owe you money,

38
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:29,990
I don't have the obligation to report my every move to you.

39
00:03:32,850 --> 00:03:35,450
Well...

40
00:03:41,490 --> 00:03:43,630
Are you running away?

41
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:46,400
You don't like drinking?

42
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,850
You can't run away like this.

43
00:03:48,850 --> 00:03:51,610
As a man.

44
00:03:52,610 --> 00:03:57,400
I don't just let people die like some people I know.

45
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:01,440
Prosecutor An, don't you think you are shameless?

46
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:07,290
You put her in jail yet you didn't flinch.

47
00:04:19,690 --> 00:04:23,850
Were there any other witnesses?

48
00:04:23,850 --> 00:04:24,650
I'm not sure.

49
00:04:24,650 --> 00:04:29,990
I transferred all the files to the procuratorial organ.

50
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:34,850
It's been 4 years, so why?

51
00:04:34,850 --> 00:04:40,330
Did she say something the other day?

52
00:04:40,330 --> 00:04:45,370
Did she claim herself to be innocent?

53
00:04:45,370 --> 00:04:47,390
Call me if you remember something.

54
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:53,380
K Corporation Legal Team...

55
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:59,130
Wait! It reminds me of something.

56
00:04:59,130 --> 00:05:03,260
A witness came to me,

57
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:06,750
gave me a K Corporation business card,

58
00:05:06,750 --> 00:05:11,110
and asked me to contact him if I found anything.

59
00:05:11,110 --> 00:05:12,100
Who is he?

60
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:15,930
Wait a minute, I might have his business card here.

61
00:05:30,550 --> 00:05:32,970
Sorry.

62
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:19,010
Prosecutor. No, lawyer. You can't do this.

63
00:06:19,010 --> 00:06:23,100
You should apply to the court to see the files.

64
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,910
Prosecutor An.

65
00:06:27,910 --> 00:06:36,330
Mr. Kim. I heard that your son got a job at K Construction.

66
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:41,440
But he originally applied for the K Hotel, right?

67
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:45,950
Take your time.

68
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:20,820
The camera is too old, and the image isn't clear.

69
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:23,200
It's impossible to identify the driver.

70
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:25,200
It took me a long time to find the license plate number.

71
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,070
If we find the black box from this car,

72
00:07:27,070 --> 00:07:30,960
we might be able to find the drum that the defendant saw.

73
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:34,910
If we have the driver's face on the black box,

74
00:07:34,910 --> 00:07:38,260
she won't be able to deny it any longer.

75
00:07:38,260 --> 00:07:43,300
This car is very common to see, so it's hard to find.

76
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:55,430
Sir, you're staying up so late.

77
00:07:55,430 --> 00:07:58,510
What are you doing in my office?

78
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:01,520
I came here to see you.

79
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:07,440
When will you announce to investigate K Corporation?

80
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:10,430
I know people can change,

81
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:13,110
but I was surprised to see you change so fast.

82
00:08:13,110 --> 00:08:17,450
When did you become a spokesman of K Corporation?

83
00:08:17,450 --> 00:08:20,310
I have some information related to Jaegyeong Corporation,

84
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:21,770
if you stop this investigation...

85
00:08:21,770 --> 00:08:24,980
Now you're making deals.

86
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:28,500
You were good at first.

87
00:08:29,350 --> 00:08:32,570
Money talks.

88
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:39,450
Be careful. There's no free lunch.

89
00:08:39,450 --> 00:08:46,410
Minhyeok looks like a spoiled rich kid,

90
00:08:46,410 --> 00:08:49,370
but he's like his father.

91
00:08:49,370 --> 00:08:53,500
Thank you for your advice.

92
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,630
You haven't slept all night,

93
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:13,670
and you got up so early.

94
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:20,010
What happened?

95
00:09:20,010 --> 00:09:24,090
Drink it. You didn't even have dinner.

96
00:09:24,090 --> 00:09:29,630
My son, San.

97
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:36,180
If he were born in another family,

98
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:37,500
he would be happy.

99
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:39,220
That's nonsense.

100
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,860
It's San because you gave birth to him.

101
00:09:40,860 --> 00:09:44,070
If not, he'd be a stranger.

102
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:48,010
What's wrong with you?

103
00:09:48,010 --> 00:09:52,050
I miss San so much.

104
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:13,340
Sister.

105
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:30,190
Sir.

106
00:10:30,190 --> 00:10:31,200
What?

107
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,420
Can I ask you something?

108
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:36,920
Do you keep black box recordings of executives' cars?

109
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,300
Why do you ask?

110
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:43,690
I want to use them as evidence to prove that Congressman Shin and President Jo are innocent.

111
00:10:43,690 --> 00:10:46,150
The security team has them.

112
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,650
Call me if necessary.

113
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:50,120
Thank you.

114
00:11:13,170 --> 00:11:15,230
What a beautiful view.

115
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:17,410
What are you doing here?

116
00:11:17,410 --> 00:11:19,620
You seem angry.

117
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:20,950
Why do you think I'm here?

118
00:11:20,950 --> 00:11:22,700
I have no time to chat with you.

119
00:11:22,700 --> 00:11:26,920
Do you like my present?

120
00:11:27,390 --> 00:11:30,100
You used to tell me

121
00:11:30,100 --> 00:11:34,470
that we were different and we wouldn't be friends.

122
00:11:34,470 --> 00:11:38,220
I guess you were right.

123
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:43,190
Don't overestimate yourself just because you can get access to my home.

124
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:49,130
The K Corporation is mine.

125
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:53,300
And stay away from Seyeon.

126
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:55,600
You can't even protect your own woman,

127
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:59,740
how dare you flirt with other guy's woman?

128
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:14,410
Keep up the good work. For my company.

129
00:12:35,810 --> 00:12:37,730
Hello.

130
00:12:37,730 --> 00:12:41,890
Sorry. I've busy preparing this event.

131
00:12:41,890 --> 00:12:43,050
Let's continue.

132
00:12:43,050 --> 00:12:45,610
Yes.

133
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:50,860
Why didn't you contact me after you left that day?

134
00:12:50,860 --> 00:12:55,150
Why didn't you contact me first?

135
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:06,230
Could you please give this to Mr. Jo?

136
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:25,100
Sir. A woman left it here.

137
00:13:36,950 --> 00:13:43,610
This is what I saved up in jail, and the money my father left.

138
00:13:43,610 --> 00:13:50,080
I'll work harder to save up more,

139
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,980
Where did she go?

140
00:13:52,980 --> 00:13:54,940
She went out that way.

141
00:14:00,230 --> 00:14:01,310
Driver!

142
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:04,260
Driver!

143
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,080
Driver!

144
00:14:49,230 --> 00:14:50,160
Hello.

145
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:52,900
How dare you!

146
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:54,840
How dare you not answering my call.

147
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,760
I'm answering you now.

148
00:14:56,760 --> 00:14:58,680
All right.

149
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:02,490
Why did you give me those money?

150
00:15:02,490 --> 00:15:04,340
I'll send it to you once a month.

151
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:05,570
No.

152
00:15:05,570 --> 00:15:07,700
I'll decide how you pay me back.

153
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:10,130
I didn't say I would accept your plan.

154
00:15:10,130 --> 00:15:12,290
Come to the hotel tomorrow.

155
00:15:16,010 --> 00:15:17,260
Are you there?

156
00:15:17,260 --> 00:15:19,990
I have something very important to do tomorrow.

157
00:15:19,990 --> 00:15:21,930
How dare you disobey me?

158
00:15:21,930 --> 00:15:25,920
Sorry, I can't cancel tomorrow's schedule.

159
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,790
Bye.

160
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,780
Tomorrow...

161
00:15:30,490 --> 00:15:32,420
How dare she!

162
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:33,910
Gwangsu!

163
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:36,580
Gwangsu!

164
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:39,860
Yes, sir!

165
00:15:39,860 --> 00:15:42,820
What's Kang Yujeong's schedule tomorrow?

166
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:46,860
Did she find a new part time job?

167
00:15:51,530 --> 00:15:53,900
Caught just off the coast.

168
00:15:54,190 --> 00:15:58,580
They're very fresh.

169
00:15:58,580 --> 00:16:02,140
Sir! Madam! Come and take a look.

170
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:06,360
Mackerels and herrings, they're very fresh.

171
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,270
Take a look.

172
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:10,650
- Come again. - What?

173
00:16:10,650 --> 00:16:12,040
When did she start coming here?

174
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:17,090
- The mackerel is fresh. - She started coming here after she got out of jail.

175
00:16:17,090 --> 00:16:17,920
They're not that good.

176
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,310
They're very fresh.

177
00:16:19,310 --> 00:16:22,170
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

178
00:16:22,170 --> 00:16:26,270
You told me to stop following her around.

179
00:16:28,070 --> 00:16:30,920
Since when did you become so obedient?

180
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:44,500
Look, these are very fresh.

181
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:47,380
Beautiful lady, come and have a look.

182
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,140
No? Come again.

183
00:16:50,140 --> 00:16:52,290
Take care.

184
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:56,620
Sir! Don't you like mackerel?

185
00:16:56,620 --> 00:16:57,380
No.

186
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:59,240
It's delicious to stew them.

187
00:17:04,330 --> 00:17:07,830
I told you not to come again, why are you still here?

188
00:17:07,830 --> 00:17:09,420
Madam, I'll do it.

189
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:11,530
Go away.

190
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:37,130
Let me...

191
00:17:57,450 --> 00:17:59,380
Take them with you.

192
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:10,600
I'll enjoy it, thank you.

193
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:13,020
I'll come back again.

194
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:46,050
Why are you hiding?

195
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:56,800
What are you doing here? This isn't your place.

196
00:18:58,330 --> 00:19:04,160
I spend half of my salary on rent, I have nothing to eat.

197
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:05,500
Right?

198
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:10,250
I'm older than you, show your respect to me.

199
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:17,970
He's my boss. He's my boss.

200
00:19:25,590 --> 00:19:26,430
So what? Let me go!

201
00:19:26,430 --> 00:19:29,650
He's your boss, not my boss.

202
00:19:29,650 --> 00:19:30,690
What's this?

203
00:19:30,690 --> 00:19:33,580
How can you say that?

204
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:38,230
Excuse her, she used to be a polite girl.

205
00:19:38,230 --> 00:19:41,900
How do you do? I'm Sandra Hwang.

206
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:45,370
You have beautiful eyes. Are you married?

207
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,880
You might get hurt.

208
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:54,490
Do you know him?

209
00:19:56,030 --> 00:20:00,600
We're having dinner. Would you like to join us?

210
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:04,290
Sandra, he's my boss.

211
00:20:04,290 --> 00:20:07,770
He won't eat something like this.

212
00:20:07,770 --> 00:20:09,780
How picky he is.

213
00:20:09,780 --> 00:20:11,740
How come he can't eat such delicious food?

214
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:14,280
Watch your mouth!

215
00:20:14,730 --> 00:20:16,580
I'm so sorry.

216
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:20,160
Let's eat together.

217
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,550
Have a seat.

218
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:27,100
She is actually kind,

219
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:29,450
but she's got a foul mouth.

220
00:20:29,450 --> 00:20:31,140
Aren't you hungry?

221
00:20:31,140 --> 00:20:34,290
The fish looks good.

222
00:20:34,290 --> 00:20:36,770
With some soup.

223
00:20:36,770 --> 00:20:39,650
Take this as my apology. Come on.

224
00:20:40,490 --> 00:20:42,770
Ah!

225
00:20:46,410 --> 00:20:47,500
That's right.

226
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:59,100
That's right.

227
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:01,190
Eating comes first anyway.

228
00:21:01,190 --> 00:21:04,250
Don't you know she can't stand fishy smell?

229
00:21:04,250 --> 00:21:07,100
She only likes sweet stuff.

230
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:09,950
Would you like a drink?

231
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:12,310
I'll have one.

232
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:13,260
Me, too.

233
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:16,640
Let's make a toast.

234
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:19,160
If you want to talk to me, come in.

235
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:37,010
What is it now?

236
00:21:37,010 --> 00:21:42,010
If you can't stand fishy smells, why do you sell seafood?

237
00:21:42,130 --> 00:21:44,830
How shameless you are.

238
00:21:44,850 --> 00:21:48,380
How dare you go to see her?

239
00:21:54,300 --> 00:22:00,790
You know I had a son.

240
00:22:05,890 --> 00:22:11,840
He was taken away from me in jail.

241
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:21,080
I couldn't be there when he died.

242
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:24,450
He was really sick,

243
00:22:25,260 --> 00:22:27,990
but I couldn't hold him in my arms.

244
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:34,680
I only had him for a year, and it hurts so much.

245
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:43,260
Seo Jihui's mother must be desperate when her daughter passed away since she raised her for so many years.

246
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:46,750
I'll atone for my sin against her for the rest of my life.

247
00:22:48,070 --> 00:22:54,430
I know I can't undo what I did.

248
00:22:55,580 --> 00:22:57,500
But...

249
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:06,150
I can't run away though it hurts so much.

250
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:36,180
Sir!

251
00:23:37,660 --> 00:23:42,120
I can't make it.

252
00:23:43,100 --> 00:23:46,360
You shouldn't have gotten into debt.

253
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:49,180
You said you wouldn't run away.

254
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:52,660
Don't pretend to be nice.

255
00:23:54,990 --> 00:23:57,020
Are you going to cry again?

256
00:23:58,140 --> 00:24:00,340
Don't cry.

257
00:24:01,020 --> 00:24:04,000
I don't want to see your cheap tears.

258
00:24:20,430 --> 00:24:22,070
Hey.

259
00:24:22,270 --> 00:24:28,360
Gwangsu. The worse I treat her, the more it hurts me.

260
00:24:39,970 --> 00:24:41,480
I'm An Dohun.

261
00:24:41,490 --> 00:24:43,680
Okay.

262
00:25:19,980 --> 00:25:21,420
Why isn't it working?

263
00:25:21,420 --> 00:25:22,190
It's not?

264
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:24,300
That's strange.

265
00:25:24,310 --> 00:25:25,340
Stay inside, okay?

266
00:25:25,340 --> 00:25:27,610
Okay.

267
00:25:40,140 --> 00:25:42,210
Sir?

268
00:25:43,120 --> 00:25:45,450
Yes.

269
00:25:49,780 --> 00:25:52,390
Would you like some coffee?

270
00:25:53,290 --> 00:25:54,960
Yes. Thank you

271
00:25:54,970 --> 00:25:57,990
You're welcome.

272
00:26:43,060 --> 00:26:47,150
What are you doing here so late?

273
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:52,330
I have no obligation to tell you what I do after my working time.

274
00:26:56,370 --> 00:26:58,860
I'm familiar with such expression.

275
00:26:58,860 --> 00:27:04,700
Someone who were caught doing something other than work at the company would have such an expression.

276
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:07,200
Right?

277
00:27:07,580 --> 00:27:09,720
We've known each other for over 4 years.

278
00:27:09,740 --> 00:27:13,400
I feel like I know a lot of things about you.

279
00:27:14,120 --> 00:27:16,570
If you knew how much I know about you,

280
00:27:16,580 --> 00:27:18,210
you might be scared.

281
00:27:18,220 --> 00:27:20,540
That's too bad.

282
00:27:20,550 --> 00:27:22,880
I don't know much about you.

283
00:27:22,890 --> 00:27:28,310
Ah! Except one thing.

284
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:32,730
You're nothing without your father.

285
00:27:32,740 --> 00:27:36,240
This is the only thing I know.

286
00:27:37,190 --> 00:27:42,000
I've walked on a thin sheet of ice.

287
00:27:42,010 --> 00:27:45,870
I am worried that the ice would break and I would fell into water.

288
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:48,220
I'm worried that I would disappoint my parents.

289
00:27:48,230 --> 00:27:51,040
I'm worried that I would crawl back to where I started.

290
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:55,510
I've made it this far by trying so hard.

291
00:27:55,520 --> 00:27:59,810
What about you?

292
00:27:59,810 --> 00:28:04,020
How do you make this far?

293
00:28:05,520 --> 00:28:07,910
Marriage?

294
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:13,390
Is that why you're using Seyeon like this?

295
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:16,800
You said you are her friend.

296
00:28:16,820 --> 00:28:19,000
Don't do that to her.

297
00:28:19,010 --> 00:28:22,410
Don't do that to your friend.

298
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:41,750
Okay. I'll check it right away.

299
00:28:41,760 --> 00:28:43,910
Your line's been busy, so...

300
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,850
I'll call you later.

301
00:28:45,860 --> 00:28:47,920
Okay.

302
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:50,460
What are you doing here?

303
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:55,670
I need to check some artwork transactions between the Shina Gallery and the K Corporation.

304
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:58,120
Really?

305
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:04,960
Does this painting have that much value?

306
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:08,530
The value of a work of art is a relative concept.

307
00:29:08,540 --> 00:29:11,160
When President Jo decides to buy it,

308
00:29:11,160 --> 00:29:14,880
the value of the paining goes up.

309
00:29:15,350 --> 00:29:17,920
I guess it goes the same with people.

310
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:22,590
Depending on who sees that person,

311
00:29:22,600 --> 00:29:26,720
he can be valuable or worthless.

312
00:29:38,260 --> 00:29:41,440
I know this isn't what you want.

313
00:29:41,450 --> 00:29:44,680
Your father and President Jo did it.

314
00:29:44,690 --> 00:29:48,480
But I was the one who closed those deals.

315
00:29:48,490 --> 00:29:50,330
It doesn't matter.

316
00:29:50,340 --> 00:29:56,120
No matter what happens, I won't let you get hurt.

317
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:32,460
Read it.

318
00:30:32,470 --> 00:30:38,590
You can find out how revenge, which started because of love, ended.

319
00:30:38,600 --> 00:30:45,760
Gwangsu, do you still believe in love?

320
00:30:46,430 --> 00:30:47,570
Yes.

321
00:30:47,590 --> 00:30:48,830
Why?

322
00:30:48,850 --> 00:30:55,770
The world is better with love than without it.

323
00:32:09,490 --> 00:32:12,290
Thank you for your cooperation.

324
00:32:14,270 --> 00:32:19,860
I need to be at the prosecutor's office tomorrow morning. I have to go.

325
00:32:34,370 --> 00:32:36,680
I don't know much about you.

326
00:32:36,690 --> 00:32:39,300
Except one thing.

327
00:32:39,310 --> 00:32:42,880
You're nothing without your father.

328
00:32:42,890 --> 00:32:47,040
Is that why you're using Seyeon like this?

329
00:32:47,050 --> 00:32:49,450
You said you were her friend.

330
00:32:49,470 --> 00:32:52,900
It sucks.

331
00:33:01,450 --> 00:33:03,970
The Hotel Rating Inspection starts today.

332
00:33:03,980 --> 00:33:07,330
Before the judges arrive...

333
00:33:08,610 --> 00:33:11,090
Why are you looking at me like that?

334
00:33:11,100 --> 00:33:13,100
You said our marriage

335
00:33:13,110 --> 00:33:15,060
is a deal.

336
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:18,570
Do you really think so?

337
00:33:18,580 --> 00:33:21,340
Yes.

338
00:33:22,310 --> 00:33:25,860
We both signed the contract.

339
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:39,170
You look good.

340
00:33:43,030 --> 00:33:47,600
It's good to see you working so hard for my company so early in the morning.

341
00:33:47,610 --> 00:33:51,970
Where are you going in such a hurry?

342
00:33:51,980 --> 00:33:55,360
Since it's working hours, I guess you should tell me now.

343
00:33:55,370 --> 00:33:59,310
I'm working hard so that your father won't have to sit in a wheelchair to work again.

344
00:33:59,320 --> 00:34:00,240
I'm busy.

345
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:04,420
Since when did you worry about my father's health?

346
00:34:04,430 --> 00:34:08,350
You'll fell relieved if your father is healthy.

347
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,780
Enough!

348
00:34:09,790 --> 00:34:11,150
Minhyeok! What's the matter with you?

349
00:34:11,160 --> 00:34:21,060
Don't side with him in front of me.

350
00:34:22,850 --> 00:34:25,800
Excuse me.

351
00:34:30,750 --> 00:34:35,570
You claimed him to be your friend.

352
00:34:35,570 --> 00:34:37,800
He's also my friend.

353
00:34:37,810 --> 00:34:39,710
You'll find out soon,

354
00:34:39,720 --> 00:34:48,970
if he is a good friend or a bad friend.

355
00:34:55,040 --> 00:34:58,360
Seyeon, look at this.

356
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:03,410
I didn't notice it this morning. I thought the fragrance came from elsewhere.

357
00:35:03,430 --> 00:35:06,480
Then I found it blossom.

358
00:35:07,230 --> 00:35:10,080
Isn't it pretty?

359
00:35:10,660 --> 00:35:13,530
It's parasitic orchid.

360
00:35:13,540 --> 00:35:18,790
Don't you think it's like a beautiful lady?

361
00:35:19,160 --> 00:35:25,620
Look at it. It has no leaves.

362
00:35:26,510 --> 00:35:28,150
This can only live off another plant.

363
00:35:28,160 --> 00:35:32,150
Thus its name.

364
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:36,450
Isn't it just like me?

365
00:35:40,920 --> 00:35:43,430
Seyeon.

366
00:35:47,730 --> 00:35:51,600
Don't be too perfect in front of Minhyeok.

367
00:35:51,620 --> 00:35:54,710
You're too smart and beautiful.

368
00:35:54,720 --> 00:36:00,040
Men instinctively don't like girls who are more excellent.

369
00:36:00,050 --> 00:36:02,070
I don't care.

370
00:36:02,080 --> 00:36:04,260
Whether he likes or not,

371
00:36:04,260 --> 00:36:07,470
he has to marry me.

372
00:36:10,170 --> 00:36:11,760
Okay.

373
00:36:17,500 --> 00:36:18,210
Enjoy your meal.

374
00:36:18,220 --> 00:36:18,910
Thank you.

375
00:36:18,920 --> 00:36:20,100
Be careful.

376
00:36:20,110 --> 00:36:21,140
OK. Thank you.

377
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:23,160
Okay.

378
00:36:24,870 --> 00:36:26,640
Honey! Honey!

379
00:36:26,660 --> 00:36:30,200
Isn't that Dohun? Oh my god.

380
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:36,350
Our son is so handsome.

381
00:36:36,450 --> 00:36:37,980
Welcome.

382
00:36:37,990 --> 00:36:40,680
Welcome, take a seat there please.

383
00:36:40,690 --> 00:36:44,240
Rich people always get away with what they did.

384
00:36:44,260 --> 00:36:47,080
Educated ones always get along with rich guys.

385
00:36:47,090 --> 00:36:50,600
They learn how to lie with their good brains.

386
00:36:50,620 --> 00:36:52,660
There's no use to learn so many things.

387
00:36:52,670 --> 00:36:54,590
Let's drink.

388
00:36:54,590 --> 00:36:55,510
Excuse me!

389
00:36:55,520 --> 00:36:56,890
Bring us some noodles.

390
00:36:56,900 --> 00:36:59,080
Okay.

391
00:36:59,360 --> 00:37:03,830
There's an accusation that the K Corporation transferred money to politicians through the Shina Gallery. Is that true?

392
00:37:04,170 --> 00:37:06,060
It's not true.

393
00:37:06,060 --> 00:37:07,360
The Shina Gallery

394
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:10,910
is a nonprofit organization which cultivates talented young artists.

395
00:37:10,910 --> 00:37:14,030
It has nothing to do with political fund.

396
00:37:14,030 --> 00:37:19,100
To clear our name, the K Corporation will cooperate with the investigation.

397
00:37:19,100 --> 00:37:26,100
If we've done anything illegal, I'll escort President Jo to the press conference.

398
00:37:26,120 --> 00:37:27,770
Thank you.

399
00:37:32,620 --> 00:37:34,300
Hello.

400
00:37:40,030 --> 00:37:43,910
It's unbelievable that Haeri treat us to such a good dinner.

401
00:37:43,910 --> 00:37:46,740
I might move to your place.

402
00:37:46,740 --> 00:37:48,470
Of course I need to treat you.

403
00:37:48,470 --> 00:37:49,830
Thank you, Haeri.

404
00:37:49,830 --> 00:37:53,880
It's so dry. I want something with soup.

405
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:59,220
Eat this, I'll get you more, madam.

406
00:37:59,220 --> 00:38:01,870
Okay. Bring us some soup, okay?

407
00:38:01,870 --> 00:38:04,220
We'd like to have seafood soup.

408
00:38:04,220 --> 00:38:05,700
Haeri.

409
00:38:07,830 --> 00:38:10,740
I saw a notice looking for a waitress at the front door.

410
00:38:10,740 --> 00:38:14,130
We have one position left to fill.

411
00:38:14,130 --> 00:38:17,730
This is great. Come with me.

412
00:38:19,520 --> 00:38:24,490
Sir! Have you found a new waitress?

413
00:38:24,490 --> 00:38:25,660
Why do you ask that?

414
00:38:25,660 --> 00:38:28,560
I want you to consider her, she has a lot of experience doing part-time jobs.

415
00:38:28,560 --> 00:38:31,580
She is experienced in different fields.

416
00:38:31,580 --> 00:38:34,790
I can assure you that she is the best.

417
00:38:34,790 --> 00:38:36,420
Is that so? What's your name?

418
00:38:36,420 --> 00:38:38,110
Kang Yujeong.

419
00:38:38,110 --> 00:38:40,030
Have you ever worked in restaurants?

420
00:38:40,030 --> 00:38:43,880
Yes. I've worked at fast food restaurants since high school,

421
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:49,630
I also worked at hotel buffet restaurants, coffee shops, fancy restaurants...

422
00:38:49,630 --> 00:38:56,050
OK. Since Haeri vouched for you, you can have a one week probation.

423
00:38:56,190 --> 00:39:00,500
Thank you so much. You won't regret it.

424
00:39:22,140 --> 00:39:26,120
Take this home. Your parents will like it.
They're fresh.

425
00:39:26,190 --> 00:39:27,400
Come back again.

426
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:31,720
Ma'am. Fresh mackerel. They're fresh and fleshy.

427
00:39:32,210 --> 00:39:35,750
Do you think I'll forgive you as long as you do something like this?

428
00:39:52,300 --> 00:39:54,080
What's this for?

429
00:40:07,940 --> 00:40:12,560
You said the culprit saw Jihui,

430
00:40:12,560 --> 00:40:14,960
but walked away, right?

431
00:40:14,960 --> 00:40:17,110
That's what the evidence says.

432
00:40:17,110 --> 00:40:20,270
We found the footprints going near her and then lead away from her.

433
00:40:20,270 --> 00:40:22,980
Are you sure they were female footprints?

434
00:40:22,990 --> 00:40:26,960
Because of the rain, it was hard to determine shape or size.

435
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:31,890
but we used them as evidence that the culprit knew the situation.

436
00:40:38,720 --> 00:40:43,820
It's possible they weren't Kang's footprints.

437
00:40:43,820 --> 00:40:46,560
Why do you keep digging into a closed case?

438
00:40:46,560 --> 00:40:50,010
Dohun checked the same file the other day as well.

439
00:40:50,150 --> 00:40:51,110
Who?

440
00:40:51,110 --> 00:40:52,220
An Dohun.

441
00:40:52,220 --> 00:40:53,450
An Dohun?

442
00:40:53,450 --> 00:40:57,200
What? What's wrong?

443
00:41:01,650 --> 00:41:04,040
They'll start an investigation,

444
00:41:04,040 --> 00:41:09,340
They won't take any action now.

445
00:41:09,340 --> 00:41:13,400
But you'd better not do anything that'll draw attention.

446
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,900
Attention?

447
00:41:14,900 --> 00:41:17,900
The biggest problem for the K Corporation

448
00:41:17,900 --> 00:41:20,500
is not the prosecution, but Jo Minhyeok.

449
00:41:20,500 --> 00:41:22,660
An Dohun!

450
00:41:26,810 --> 00:41:28,050
Go ahead.

451
00:41:28,050 --> 00:41:32,760
The board members aren't satisified with your son at the moment.

452
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:35,810
The K Hotel's having financial problems,

453
00:41:35,810 --> 00:41:38,710
and there's only so much Seyeon can do.

454
00:41:38,710 --> 00:41:41,920
They all know about your health problem as well.

455
00:41:41,920 --> 00:41:44,480
What are you talking about?

456
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:49,640
How many times president Jo has been to Germany in the past 2 years

457
00:41:49,640 --> 00:41:52,720
you are more aware of it than me.

458
00:41:52,720 --> 00:41:55,690
I used to think it had something to do with overseas investment,

459
00:41:55,690 --> 00:41:57,930
but I was wrong.

460
00:41:59,930 --> 00:42:04,570
How bad is your health?

461
00:42:05,450 --> 00:42:10,320
It will take Minhyeok a long time

462
00:42:10,320 --> 00:42:12,470
to take over the K Corporation.

463
00:42:16,100 --> 00:42:18,470
Is Minhyeok in his room?

464
00:42:18,470 --> 00:42:21,950
He doesn't start until this afternoon.

465
00:42:21,950 --> 00:42:24,230
Take Dohun to his room.

466
00:42:24,230 --> 00:42:28,680
Persuade him.

467
00:42:28,680 --> 00:42:34,080
Maybe he'll grow up when someone hurts his dignity.

468
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:42,270
He'll be here soon. Wait here.

469
00:42:42,270 --> 00:42:43,780
Thank you.

470
00:42:45,050 --> 00:42:52,170
Watch your mouth. Don't say too much.

471
00:43:15,310 --> 00:43:21,390
We've known each other for over 4 years, I feel like I know a lot of things about you.

472
00:43:21,390 --> 00:43:26,400
If you knew how much I know about you, you might be scared.

473
00:43:33,900 --> 00:43:37,420
What are you doing in my room?

474
00:43:45,310 --> 00:43:50,450
You inflated the price of the Incheon Hotel. Where's the rest of the money?

475
00:43:52,680 --> 00:43:56,710
I heard that the K Hotel put pressure on the union

476
00:43:56,710 --> 00:43:59,340
while ignoring the Labor Committee's advice.

477
00:43:59,340 --> 00:44:04,140
They could impose a business suspension. Don't you know that?

478
00:44:04,140 --> 00:44:08,540
That's why I hired you.

479
00:44:24,500 --> 00:44:27,520
Thousands of people's jobs are on the line.

480
00:44:27,880 --> 00:44:29,480
I hope you can be more serious.

481
00:44:29,480 --> 00:44:31,680
How dare you?

482
00:44:31,680 --> 00:44:35,020
You seem to forget the reality.

483
00:44:35,020 --> 00:44:38,670
I'm the owner and I know that more than anyone.

484
00:44:38,670 --> 00:44:42,300
You can just do what I tell you to do.

485
00:44:42,350 --> 00:44:44,590
Okay.

486
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:49,610
About Kang Yujeong.

487
00:44:50,060 --> 00:44:54,580
She was the woman I used to love.

488
00:44:54,580 --> 00:44:57,360
Treat her with respect.

489
00:45:00,260 --> 00:45:04,360
I don't know what you're trying to do to her.

490
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:10,130
But I won't be at the mercy of you anymore.

491
00:45:14,350 --> 00:45:17,220
The hit-and-run occurred 4 years ago.

492
00:45:17,830 --> 00:45:19,390
I wonder why

493
00:45:19,390 --> 00:45:22,530
you had to look up the investigation report again.

494
00:45:36,580 --> 00:45:40,550
We have to go. Your father is waiting for you.

495
00:45:40,980 --> 00:45:42,850
Okay.

496
00:46:06,260 --> 00:46:08,990
I should've poured that for you.

497
00:46:08,990 --> 00:46:11,910
Thanks to you, we passed the rating inspection.

498
00:46:11,910 --> 00:46:14,050
As long as you know.

499
00:46:14,060 --> 00:46:18,770
You heard about the party next week, right? Are you coming?

500
00:46:20,400 --> 00:46:23,120
Let me think about it.

501
00:46:28,320 --> 00:46:29,830
Seyeon!

502
00:46:31,310 --> 00:46:35,930
Suppose I killed someone.

503
00:46:36,050 --> 00:46:40,790
And I had to go to jail. What would you do?

504
00:46:42,420 --> 00:46:44,850
I'd hire the best lawyer,

505
00:46:44,850 --> 00:46:46,540
I'd meet the prosecutor, the judge,

506
00:46:46,540 --> 00:46:49,650
or even the chief justice, if I had to.

507
00:46:49,650 --> 00:46:52,020
What if I still had to go to jail?

508
00:46:52,020 --> 00:46:54,690
You wouldn't go to jail.

509
00:46:54,690 --> 00:46:57,410
I wouldn't let you.

510
00:47:15,090 --> 00:47:17,370
Shit.

511
00:48:01,450 --> 00:48:02,900
Dohun.

512
00:48:05,490 --> 00:48:07,370
What's going on?

513
00:48:07,430 --> 00:48:09,610
We're friends, right?

514
00:48:09,610 --> 00:48:11,030
Right.

515
00:48:11,130 --> 00:48:15,140
Can I ask you a favor, as a friend?

516
00:48:15,790 --> 00:48:18,060
Can you make some time next Wednesday?

517
00:48:18,060 --> 00:48:22,500
Is this about the party that Minhyeok's hosting?

518
00:48:23,830 --> 00:48:24,700
Yes.

519
00:48:24,700 --> 00:48:26,430
Okay.

520
00:48:26,670 --> 00:48:30,050
Can you tell me why?

521
00:48:30,130 --> 00:48:33,190
Are you trying to draw attention from Minhyeok?

522
00:48:33,190 --> 00:48:37,890
Or do you really want to go with me?

523
00:48:39,970 --> 00:48:41,050
Well, Minhyeok is...

524
00:48:41,050 --> 00:48:45,800
I'll go. I heard your answer.

525
00:48:56,800 --> 00:48:58,990
Good work, prosecutor An.

526
00:48:59,410 --> 00:49:02,080
You did a better job than I had expected.

527
00:49:02,080 --> 00:49:06,980
Putting aside any personal feelings, you only follow the law.

528
00:49:07,160 --> 00:49:10,980
Trust me. No one was there. I didn't see anybody.

529
00:49:10,980 --> 00:49:14,270
A truck just jumped out in front of us,

530
00:49:14,270 --> 00:49:16,920
and the car slipped, and we...

531
00:49:25,580 --> 00:49:31,920
No! I... I hit the drum in the construction site nearby.

532
00:49:31,920 --> 00:49:35,500
No, this can't be true. I don't know.

533
00:49:35,830 --> 00:49:38,600
I didn't hit anyone.

534
00:49:38,600 --> 00:49:42,610
Because of the rain, it was hard to tell the shape or size,

535
00:49:42,610 --> 00:49:47,120
But we found footprints walking away from the victim.

536
00:49:47,120 --> 00:49:51,550
It's possible they weren't Kang's footprints.

537
00:49:51,770 --> 00:49:56,230
I don't think I paid for what I did.

538
00:49:56,230 --> 00:50:02,600
I won't forget it as long as I live.

539
00:50:09,290 --> 00:50:14,800
I'm ashamed of what I did to that woman.

540
00:50:22,360 --> 00:50:23,810
Gwangsu.

541
00:50:24,480 --> 00:50:25,830
Yes, sir.

542
00:50:28,000 --> 00:50:29,860
Dig deeper.

543
00:50:31,270 --> 00:50:32,830
Yes, sir.

544
00:50:47,860 --> 00:50:50,580
How are you going pay me back working like this?

545
00:50:55,070 --> 00:50:57,880
That's why I'm working hard.

546
00:50:58,800 --> 00:51:01,800
Don't interrupt me if you want your money.

547
00:51:03,300 --> 00:51:04,570
What are you doing?

548
00:51:04,570 --> 00:51:11,120
On the night of the accident, you saw Jihui, and walked away. Right?

549
00:51:12,130 --> 00:51:16,240
Did you really see her and walk away?

550
00:51:22,400 --> 00:51:28,390
Yes! I did it. What more do you want from me?

551
00:51:29,440 --> 00:51:34,960
Haven't you tortured me enough for all these years?

552
00:51:43,570 --> 00:51:47,010
When can you pay me back by doing this?

553
00:51:47,230 --> 00:51:49,060
You want to stop seeing me, right?

554
00:51:49,060 --> 00:51:50,560
Go with me.

555
00:52:08,230 --> 00:52:10,120
Put this on her.

556
00:52:12,710 --> 00:52:14,650
Please come with me.

557
00:52:14,650 --> 00:52:18,050
I...

558
00:52:18,050 --> 00:52:19,580
If you do what I ask you to do today,

559
00:52:19,580 --> 00:52:22,250
I'll deduct this month's debt.

560
00:52:22,250 --> 00:52:24,530
Driver.

561
00:52:43,520 --> 00:52:44,880
Sorry.

562
00:52:44,880 --> 00:52:47,870
Sorry.

563
00:52:47,870 --> 00:52:50,300
That's all right.

564
00:52:56,870 --> 00:52:59,180
I don't like the design.

565
00:53:07,470 --> 00:53:08,730
Try this one.

566
00:53:29,470 --> 00:53:30,660
Good.

567
00:53:45,850 --> 00:53:51,200
I remember. It was 4 years ago?

568
00:53:51,200 --> 00:53:54,070
Can you give me more details?

569
00:54:19,790 --> 00:54:23,250
Where is Minhyeok? Why are you here alone?

570
00:54:23,850 --> 00:54:26,930
This is Attorney An Dohun

571
00:54:26,930 --> 00:54:28,660
from the K Corporation Legal Team.

572
00:54:31,880 --> 00:54:36,140
What? Are you exchanging partner with each other?

573
00:54:36,690 --> 00:54:38,410
Who is that girl?

574
00:54:45,180 --> 00:54:49,930
Don't mind her. She does everything Minhyeok asks her to do

575
00:54:49,930 --> 00:54:53,200
to pay back the debt that she owes him.

576
00:55:45,290 --> 00:55:46,440
Seyeon.

577
00:55:47,160 --> 00:55:49,800
What is it? What do you want to do?

578
00:55:49,800 --> 00:55:53,830
Sorry! I didn't know you'd come today.

579
00:55:53,830 --> 00:55:58,030
Is that why you brought her here?

580
00:55:58,030 --> 00:55:59,560
No...

581
00:56:03,470 --> 00:56:05,980
I never said I wouldn't come.

582
00:56:05,980 --> 00:56:08,280
When you asked me,

583
00:56:09,120 --> 00:56:11,730
I said I'd think about it.

584
00:56:18,020 --> 00:56:19,660
What's wrong with you?

585
00:56:19,940 --> 00:56:21,880
I told you that I'd deal with him

586
00:56:21,880 --> 00:56:23,850
by myself.

587
00:56:23,850 --> 00:56:25,390
I didn't know you'd be here.

588
00:56:25,390 --> 00:56:29,090
If I weren't here, you'd follow him anywhere?

589
00:56:29,090 --> 00:56:30,320
What are you wearing?

590
00:56:30,320 --> 00:56:32,230
I had no choice. He forced me to do it.

591
00:56:32,230 --> 00:56:37,320
If he asked, would you sell yourself?

592
00:57:00,690 --> 00:57:04,300
Sorry. Are you okay?

593
00:57:04,300 --> 00:57:06,870
Yes. Thank you.

594
00:57:06,870 --> 00:57:08,320
How much?

595
00:57:09,820 --> 00:57:11,170
What?

596
00:57:11,450 --> 00:57:15,230
I heard you would do everything Minhyeok ask to pay off the debt.

597
00:57:15,230 --> 00:57:18,690
I'll pay off the debt for you.

598
00:57:19,410 --> 00:57:24,890
Would you do everything I ask you to do?

599
00:57:24,890 --> 00:57:26,800
It's not like that.

600
00:57:26,800 --> 00:57:28,540
Then...

601
00:57:32,040 --> 00:57:33,410
You look beautiful.

602
00:57:36,490 --> 00:57:39,280
I like it. Come here.

603
00:57:41,640 --> 00:57:45,510
Are you crazy? Hey! Come here!

604
00:57:45,510 --> 00:57:47,320
Stay still.

605
00:57:54,300 --> 00:57:55,500
Stop.

606
00:58:07,240 --> 00:58:13,110
You're substandard product.

607
00:58:31,880 --> 00:58:33,310
Get up!

608
00:58:33,310 --> 00:58:35,460
What is it?

609
00:58:35,920 --> 00:58:39,130
You still have a bad taste.

610
00:58:41,090 --> 00:58:42,510
What happened?

611
00:58:42,510 --> 00:58:45,460
She'd do anything for money, right?

612
00:58:45,460 --> 00:58:47,330
Don't prentend to be noble.

613
00:58:47,330 --> 00:58:51,300
Go buy a clothes.

614
00:58:56,840 --> 00:58:58,850
Minhyeok, look at the wound.

615
00:59:05,650 --> 00:59:08,250
She'd do anything.

616
00:59:11,430 --> 00:59:16,980
Only for me.

617
00:59:17,360 --> 00:59:18,780
You bastard.

618
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:29,590
What's going on? Where's Gwangsu?

619
00:59:30,620 --> 00:59:32,180
I don't know.

620
00:59:36,840 --> 00:59:40,300
Yes. What?

621
00:59:40,300 --> 00:59:42,480
A board meeting at this time

622
00:59:42,480 --> 00:59:45,040
What? Dismissal?

623
01:00:24,340 --> 01:00:28,930
Jo Minhyeok. I'll forgive you this time, but I won't let it slide again.

624
01:00:28,930 --> 01:00:30,520
Let's wati and see.

625
01:00:31,900 --> 01:00:37,900
You're going to pay for this.

626
01:00:38,890 --> 01:00:42,320
Substandard product, I'll see you again.

627
01:00:53,330 --> 01:00:54,260
Yes.

628
01:00:54,260 --> 01:00:56,430
They came together.

629
01:00:56,790 --> 01:01:00,270
The owner said he proposed to her on that night.

630
01:01:00,270 --> 01:01:01,950
When was it?

631
01:01:01,950 --> 01:01:03,820
On the same night.

632
01:01:10,120 --> 01:01:11,600
Are you sure?

633
01:01:11,600 --> 01:01:16,260
Yes. It was the night of the accident.

634
01:01:17,930 --> 01:01:22,490
Due to a business slump, a high vacancy rate,

635
01:01:22,490 --> 01:01:25,350
and a scandal regarding the Incheon Harbor,

636
01:01:25,350 --> 01:01:28,840
we're here to discuss Jo Minhyeok's dismissal.

637
01:01:53,570 --> 01:02:00,160
I think I have enough shares to attend the meeting.

638
01:02:00,650 --> 01:02:05,240
- What? - The board meeting wants to dismiss Joe Minhyeok.

639
01:02:05,240 --> 01:02:09,720
I can't believe this! How many will be against it?

640
01:02:09,720 --> 01:02:13,210
More than half of the members will vote against it if you want them to.

641
01:02:13,210 --> 01:02:15,140
Call them.

642
01:02:38,280 --> 01:02:43,820
Why don't we start the vote?

643
01:02:48,720 --> 01:02:56,060
We'll start the vote regarding to the dismissal of Jo Minhyeok.

644
01:02:56,060 --> 01:03:01,140
If you're in favor, raise your hand.

645
01:03:16,050 --> 01:03:19,600
Let's go, don't stay here.

646
01:03:32,650 --> 01:03:33,890
What are you doing?

647
01:03:37,500 --> 01:03:40,510
What are you thinking about?
